    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Cozy Dungeons</strong> is an adventure/interior design game where you explore dungeons, clear them out of enemies and renovate them for a profit! Take control of the leader of a monster extermination guild that decides to add a decorative spin to the business. After all, why just conquer a dungeon when you can turn it into a B&amp;B?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE TREACHEROUS DUNGEONS</h2>Make your way through dungeons full of devious puzzles, vicious enemies and lethal traps. Use a variety of tools that will help you in exploration and combat, and keep your wits about you - they might just give you the edge you need to survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377600/extras/df1bf2d2d6cd8af4c97e939bade55fd7.poster.avif?t=1736370420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377600/extras/df1bf2d2d6cd8af4c97e939bade55fd7.webm?t=1736370420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLEASH YOUR INNER RENOVATOR</h2>Every dungeon you visit belongs to a client, and they want to see it looking brand-new! Build new furniture, clean up garbage, change the walls and floor, sell broken furniture and much more! Once you\u2019re all set, let the gold roll in!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377600/extras/965184e5e6e3e5abc8095391abdaac3a.poster.avif?t=1736370420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377600/extras/965184e5e6e3e5abc8095391abdaac3a.webm?t=1736370420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR GUILD</h2>You can spend your hard-earned gold to decorate and expand your Guild however you want, improve your character, buy new blueprints, meet new friends and more - the sky\u2019s the limit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377600/extras/1b02dd524c59bc01a8aacde3e9d09e62.poster.avif?t=1736370420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377600/extras/1b02dd524c59bc01a8aacde3e9d09e62.webm?t=1736370420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
