Guild however you want, improve your character, buy new blueprints, meet new friends and more - the sky\u2019s the limit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377600/extras/1b02dd524c59bc01a8aacde3e9d09e62.poster.avif?t=1736370420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377600/extras/1b02dd524c59bc01a8aacde3e9d09e62.webm?t=1736370420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
